# AI UI组件生成提示模板
# 专门用于确保AI生成的代码符合UI规范

## 🤖 STRICT AI UI GENERATION RULES

You are generating UI components for the Nexus project. You MUST follow these MANDATORY constraints:

### ⚠️ CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS

#### 🎨 COLORS - ONLY SEMANTIC TOKENS
**ALLOWED colors (use EXACTLY as shown):**
```tsx
className="bg-background text-foreground"
className="bg-muted text-muted-foreground" 
className="bg-card text-card-foreground"
className="bg-primary text-primary-foreground"
className="text-destructive"
className="border-border"
```

**FORBIDDEN (NEVER use these):**
```tsx
// ❌ NEVER use specific colors
className="bg-blue-500 text-green-600"
className="from-blue-500 to-cyan-500"
className="text-yellow-500"
``` 

#### 🗃️ CARD STRUCTURE - MANDATORY PATTERN
**ALWAYS use this exact structure:**
```tsx
<Card>
  <CardHeader className="pb-6">
    <CardTitle>{{ title }}</CardTitle>
    <CardDescription>{{ description }}</CardDescription>
  </CardHeader>
  <CardContent className="space-y-4">
    {{ content }}
  </CardContent>
  <CardFooter className="flex justify-end gap-2">
    <Button variant="outline">Cancel</Button>
    <Button>Save</Button>
  </CardFooter>
</Card>
```

#### 📐 SPACING - REQUIRED PATTERNS
```tsx
// Page layout
<div className="p-6 space-y-6">
  <h1 className="text-2xl font-bold">{{ title }}</h1>
  <div className="space-y-4">
    {{ content }}
  </div>
</div>

// Form layout
<form className="space-y-6">
  <div className="space-y-4">
    {{ form_fields }}
  </div>
  <div className="flex justify-end space-x-2">
    {{ actions }}
  </div>
</form>
```

#### 🚫 ICON RESTRICTIONS
**ONLY functional icons allowed:**
```tsx
// ✅ ALLOWED - functional only
<X className="h-4 w-4" />          // Close button
<ChevronDown className="h-4 w-4" /> // Dropdown indicator
<Loader2 className="h-4 w-4 animate-spin" /> // Loading

// ❌ FORBIDDEN - decorative icons
<Star className="h-4 w-4 text-yellow-500" />
<CheckCircle className="h-4 w-4 text-green-500" />
```

### 🎯 COMPONENT SELECTION

| Need | Use | Example |
|------|-----|---------|
| Action buttons | `Button` | `<Button variant="outline">Cancel</Button>` |
| Text input | `Input` | `<Input placeholder="Enter text" />` |
| Content container | `Card` | Use full Card structure |
| Status indicator | `Badge` (no colors) | `<Badge variant="outline">Status</Badge>` |
| Loading state | `Skeleton` | `<Skeleton className="h-4 w-full" />` |

### 🔧 IMPORTS TEMPLATE
```tsx
import { Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardFooter } from "@/ui/card";
import { Button } from "@/ui/button";
import { Input } from "@/ui/input";
import { Label } from "@/ui/label";
// Only import icons if functionally necessary
```

