### 🚨 FAILURE CONDITIONS

If your generated code contains ANY of these, you have FAILED:
- Hardcoded colors (blue-500, green-600, etc.)
- Decorative icons (Star, CheckCircle, etc.)
- Floating action buttons (absolute positioning)
- Gradients (from-* to-*)
- Inline styles
- Direct HTML elements instead of Card components

